        "content": "Transformer ArchitectureCore Components Encoder Stack:produces contextual representations of the input.Decoder Stack: usesthe encoder's output and previous decoder outputs to generate the target sequence.Self-Attention Mechanism: allowsthe model to focus on different parts of the input sequence when processing each token.Feed-Forward Neural Networks: apply nonlinear transformation per token.Key idea: no recurrence, no convolution —only attention."
