        "token_count": 80,
        "content": "SummaryBERT is a deep bidirectional Transformer encoder pre-trained using masked language modelling.Bidirectional self-attention allows each token to attend to both its left and right context.BERT popularisedthe large-scale pretrain–then-fine-tune paradigm in NLP .Achieved state-of-the-art performance (2018) across diverse NLU tasks."
